  longDescription:
    "DUNE: IMPERIUM is a 2020 CRITICALLY-ACCLAIMED HYBRID DECK-BUILDING + WORKER-PLACEMENT BOARD GAME designed by PAUL DENNEN (also designer of CLANK! and CLANK! IN! SPACE!) + published by DIRE WOLF DIGITAL — set in FRANK HERBERT's iconic DUNE UNIVERSE (novel 1965; David Lynch film 1984; Denis Villeneuve films 2021 + 2024). It EXPLODED IN POPULARITY tied to the Villeneuve DUNE film releases + is regarded as ONE OF THE BEST WORKER-PLACEMENT + DECK-BUILDING FUSION GAMES ever designed. OVERVIEW: 1-4 players (solo mode uses AI 'HOUSE HAGAL' automa) take on GREAT HOUSES OF THE LANDSRAAD (Atreides, Harkonnen, House Ecaz, House Richese, additional houses in expansions) competing for CONTROL OF ARRAKIS + INFLUENCE over the 4 major factions of the Imperium. FIRST TO 10 VICTORY POINTS (VP) WINS. CORE INNOVATION: HYBRID DECK-BUILDING + WORKER-PLACEMENT — a genre-defining fusion. TURN STRUCTURE: Each turn, player has TWO CHOICES with each of their cards from a 5-card hand: (1) AGENT TURN — PLAY the card + send an AGENT (worker) to a game board space (spaces require specific card icons: green [agriculture], yellow [politics], blue [spice trade], red [military]). Agent-placed spaces trigger effects (gain resources, influence, cards, VP). (2) REVEAL TURN — Discard the card into the REVEAL POOL; when all your cards are revealed at once, they contribute PERSUASION (for buying new cards) + SWORDS (for the round's Conflict combat). PLAYERS AGENT-PLACE ~2-3 CARDS per round, then REVEAL the remaining ~2-3 cards. GAME BOARD: Central map of ARRAKIS + LANDSRAAD influence tracks for 4 FACTIONS (EMPEROR, SPACING GUILD, BENE GESSERIT, FREMEN). Gaining influence with factions unlocks their unique VP + effect triggers. SPICE + SOLARI: Spice is the game's main resource-currency; solari (money) is secondary. SPICE HARVESTED from Arrakis territories + traded/spent for cards + VP. CONFLICTS: Each round has a random CONFLICT CARD showing rewards + territory to be contested. Players commit TROOPS (via cards + agent effects) + SWORDS (from revealed cards) for combat; top 3 players receive graduated rewards including VP + spice + influence. DECK-BUILDING: Players start with basic 10-card starter deck; over the game acquire new cards from a MARKET ROW (via Persuasion spent when revealing cards). Cards range from cheap tricks to powerful specialist cards. RANKINGS: BGG TOP 15 as of 2020s; multiple GAME OF THE YEAR awards + critical acclaim. GAME LENGTH: 60-120 minutes (much shorter than most heavy Euros — a KEY ADVANTAGE). WEIGHT: BGG weight ~3.3/5 — MEDIUM-HEAVY, more accessible than Age of Steam or Brass Birmingham. EXPANSIONS: RISE OF IX (2021) — adds House Ix + technology tiles + dreadnought units + new leaders + IMMORTALITY EXPANSION rules. IMMORTALITY (2022) — adds Bene Tleilax faction + cloning + Ghola cards + new leaders. DUNE: IMPERIUM UPRISING (2023) — standalone deluxe reimplementation with team play + new leaders. DIGITAL: DUNE: IMPERIUM DIGITAL (Steam, 2022+) — official app by DIRE WOLF; also on iOS + Android; excellent solo AI + online multiplayer. Considered one of the best board-game-to-app conversions.",
